  "entry": "E08",
  "article": "Nvidia Uses The Specter of Huawei to Make Its Chip Exports Case",
  "gold_statement": "In March, it introduced a new chip, the 950PR, and is preparing to launch another later this year.",
  "gold_meaning": {
   "who": "Huawei",
   "what": "launched the 950PR AI chip and is preparing another",
   "period": "950PR in March; the next later this year",
