  "article": "Maximize Spectral Efficiency with AI-Native RAN and NVIDIA AI Aerial",
  "gold_statement": "SoftBank and NVIDIA recently reported stable outdoor 16-layer massive MU-MIMO operation on a GPU-based AI-RAN platform",
  "gold_meaning": {
